	To investigate the impact of data, we first evaluate our method using only the generated data. We show the results of our method in the Table \ref{table:1}. We have used the model that is trained only using generated data. In the test phase, we have evaluated our method using only the generated data for summarizing. We have generated 50 sentences for each paragraph by our model.

