\section{Background}
\subsection{Data}

We used two datasets from Kaggle. One was used as the training data and the other as the testing data. Both datasets are in json format and have two files: training data (train.json) and testing data (test.json). Each file contains multiple documents with a list of sentences. In the document, we need to find the document id, paragraph id, question id, and answer span id.

